{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261025/photo/bkn-20261025023357838-1025_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261025030943\"/><p>其中一輛私家車車頭嚴重損毀，車頭蓋撞至摺起。</p><p>大埔發生3車相撞交通意外。今日(25日)凌晨1時19分，3輛私家車駛至汀角路近犁壁山新村對開時相撞，意外後，其中2輛私家車剷上路旁花槽上。事件中，有1人腳傷，清醒送院救治。警員到場調查，3輛私家車均損毀，其中一輛車頭蓋撞至摺起。意外起因則有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T19:20:17.832346+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T18:33:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:38:16.618381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:18:12.409988+00:00","content_hash":"6907628ec7687650f2ef7d481f3c9fb1a79f9719f2118c5847257be2a992ec73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}